OL,3,GNEWSAThe strange case of Miss X and
OL,4,AScotland's 'most haunted' house
OL,5,
OL,6,FDeep in Highland Perthshire stood a
OL,7,Fmansion with the undesirable reputation
OL,8,Fof being Scotland's "most haunted
OL,9,Fhouse".
OL,11,FBallechin appeared to have it all -
OL,12,Fghostly hounds, a spectral nun,
OL,13,Ffloating beds - and rapping on walls
OL,14,Fthat kept residents and guests up at
OL,15,Fnight.
OL,17,FVictorian Britain was enthralled by the
OL,18,Falleged spooky goings on, but was it
OL,19,Fcaused by ghosts or dodgy water pipes
OL,20,Fand cheeky children?
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,427,420,260,160,0,100
