OL,3,GNEWSAThe strange case of Miss X and
OL,4,AScotland's 'most haunted' house
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn English medium - Ada Goodrich Freer,
OL,7,Faka Miss X - headed north to discover
OL,8,Fthe truth, and her investigation would
OL,9,Finfluence ghost hunters and the horror
OL,10,Fgenre for generations after.
